WEBVTT

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:06.631
Captain's Log, Stardate 48734.2.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.140
Sometimes it's a good idea

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:10.870
to get away from being
a Captain for awhile.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:13.105
To that end,
I've started participating

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:14.977
in a new holonovel.

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:16.811
The setting is ancient England.

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:24.549
The drawing room is in here.

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:28.254
Bridget, take
Mrs. Davenport's cape

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:29.921
and tell Lord Burleigh
that she's here.

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:30.930
Yes, ma'am.

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.693
There's tea.

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:34.324
That would be lovely.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:35.527
Thank you.

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:39.372
Tea is usually served at 5:30,

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:41.499
and dinner is at 8:30.

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:44.806
His Lordship doesn't appreciate
being kept waiting.

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:47.312
I'll be sure to be prompt.

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:48.336
Yes, ma'am.

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:55.178
Let's make something clear,
Mrs. Davenport.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.519
My job is to make sure

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.616
that this household
runs smoothly.

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:02.753
I have been with Lord Burleigh
for nearly 20 years

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:05.924
because this household
runs smoothly.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:08.593
He has come to trust me

00:01:08.635 --> 00:01:10.967
and I will not brook
any behavior

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:13.302
that might jeopardize
that trust.

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:15.933
So you will be expected
to follow the rules

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:17.533
that I have set down.

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:21.513
Mrs. Templeton...

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:23.106
I have no wish to do anything

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.912
that might disrupt
this household,

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:29.149
but let me make something
perfectly clear.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.623
I have been hired
by Lord Burleigh,

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:36.357
and it's his orders
I will follow, not yours.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:41.895
You would be wise
not to make an enemy of me.

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:44.199
I can make sure
we have another governess

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:46.171
by next week.

00:01:46.206 --> 00:01:49.471
I suggest we try to get along,
Mrs. Templeton.

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:52.774
Surely there's room here
for both of us?

00:01:57.317 --> 00:01:59.877
One lump or two?

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:04.546
Two, please.

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:13.928
Lord Burleigh will
be here directly.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:04.774
Forgive me.

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:06.114
I've startled you.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.380
I'm sorry.

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:08.853
I didn't hear you come in.

00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:12.324
Mrs. Davenport,
I'll come to the point.

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:15.725
I am not an easy man
to live with.

00:03:15.762 --> 00:03:19.129
Since my wife died,
I'm told I'm even worse.

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.966
She was a buffer for me.

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:24.128
I understand.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:26.968
The children are the ones
who've suffered.

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:28.631
I've not been much
of a father to them,

00:03:28.675 --> 00:03:29.664
and God knows,

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:31.006
I can't be a mother.

00:03:33.446 --> 00:03:35.346
I'm not asking
that you replace their mother,

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:38.316
but I think they'll respond
to a woman's sensibilities.

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:39.784
You might fill a void
in their lives.

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:43.277
I'll certainly try, Your Grace.

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:45.723
Young Henry
is sometimes a bit stubborn,

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:49.888
and little Beatrice...
misses her mother terribly.

00:03:49.929 --> 00:03:52.898
I hope they won't make
things difficult for you.

00:03:55.201 --> 00:03:58.602
One thing above all
I must demand.

00:03:58.638 --> 00:04:01.607
You are never,
under any circumstances,

00:04:01.641 --> 00:04:05.042
to go onto the fourth floor,
is that clear?

00:04:05.078 --> 00:04:07.273
Bridge to Captain Janeway.

00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:09.372
Go ahead, Mr. Kim.

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:10.848
I've got Commander Chakotay

00:04:10.883 --> 00:04:13.215
and Mr. Tuvok's shuttlecraft
on long-range sensors,

00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:15.414
but they're not responding
to our hails.

00:04:15.455 --> 00:04:17.116
The shuttle's
been badly damaged.

00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:18.953
I'm reading
multiple hull fractures.

00:04:19.025 --> 00:04:20.049
Life signs?

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:22.254
Two, but they're very faint.

00:04:22.295 --> 00:04:23.956
Beam them to Sick Bay
as soon as they're in range.

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:25.189
I'm on my way.

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:26.562
Aye, Captain.

00:04:32.872 --> 00:04:34.100
Doctor.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.505
They've each taken
a blast to the head

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:37.270
by some kind
of energy discharge.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.368
Cardiostimulator.

00:04:38.411 --> 00:04:40.777
Mr. Tuvok has
a serious concussion,

00:04:40.813 --> 00:04:42.246
but it's nothing I can't handle.

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:43.977
As for Commander Chakotay...

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.347
all of the bio-neural energy

00:04:45.385 --> 00:04:46.977
has been extracted
from his brain.

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:48.248
Extracted?

00:04:48.288 --> 00:04:50.984
Yes, from the looks of it,
someone drained the energy

00:04:51.057 --> 00:04:52.854
from every single
axon and dendrite

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:54.223
right down to the synapses.

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:55.227
I can keep his heart beating,

00:04:55.261 --> 00:04:56.285
and I can keep him breathing,

00:04:56.329 --> 00:04:58.297
but other than that,
there's nothing I can do.

00:04:59.766 --> 00:05:01.393
He's brain dead.

00:06:54.612 --> 00:06:57.342
The attack lasted
no more than a few seconds,

00:06:57.381 --> 00:06:58.905
but it was highly effective.

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:02.078
I feel Commander Chakotay and I
are fortunate to be alive.

00:07:02.119 --> 00:07:03.677
What happened, Lieutenant?

00:07:03.721 --> 00:07:06.053
We had completed our trade
mission with the llidarians

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:08.217
and were on course
to the rendezvous point

00:07:08.259 --> 00:07:10.784
when we encountered
a dark-matter nebula.

00:07:10.828 --> 00:07:13.160
As we began a routine analysis,

00:07:13.197 --> 00:07:16.325
an unidentified ship emerged
and attacked our shuttle.

00:07:16.367 --> 00:07:17.766
Any idea why?

00:07:17.802 --> 00:07:20.862
No. They would not
respond to our hails.

00:07:20.905 --> 00:07:23.601
We were hit
by an energy discharge,

00:07:23.641 --> 00:07:26.735
which penetrated our shields,
and filled the cabin.

00:07:26.777 --> 00:07:28.768
Commander Chakotay
lost consciousness

00:07:28.813 --> 00:07:30.940
immediately,
and I was barely able

00:07:31.048 --> 00:07:33.846
to activate the autopilot
before I was overcome as well.

00:07:33.884 --> 00:07:35.647
And the alien ship?

00:07:36.687 --> 00:07:37.915
The last image I saw

00:07:37.955 --> 00:07:40.446
was the ship
flying back into the nebula,

00:07:40.491 --> 00:07:43.654
but the details
are difficult to remember.

00:07:43.694 --> 00:07:46.492
Can you tell me anything
about the energy discharge...

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:48.964
its modulation
or phase distribution?

00:07:49.033 --> 00:07:49.965
No.

00:07:50.034 --> 00:07:52.229
There was no time
for a detailed analysis.

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:56.206
However, the shuttle's sensors
may have recorded information

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:57.537
that could be helpful.

00:07:57.575 --> 00:07:59.167
I will download the sensor logs.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:01.075
Why would someone
want to extract

00:08:01.112 --> 00:08:03.046
his bio-neural energy?

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:05.878
I don't know,
but if I'm to have

00:08:05.916 --> 00:08:07.850
any hope of reviving him,
I must know precisely

00:08:07.885 --> 00:08:09.910
how his neurons were depleted.

00:08:09.954 --> 00:08:12.445
It would be a great help
if I could examine the weapon.

00:08:13.758 --> 00:08:15.089
We're going back to that nebula

00:08:15.126 --> 00:08:16.327
to try to find the ship
that attacked you.

00:08:16.327 --> 00:08:17.453
To try to find the ship
that attacked you.

00:08:17.494 --> 00:08:18.791
Janeway to Bridge.

00:08:18.829 --> 00:08:20.558
Prepare to lay in a new course.

00:08:20.597 --> 00:08:22.588
Mr. Tuvok will provide
you with the coordinates.

00:08:22.633 --> 00:08:23.600
Aye, Captain.

00:08:23.634 --> 00:08:25.397
We'll keep you posted, Doctor.

00:08:38.248 --> 00:08:39.374
The energy discharge

00:08:39.416 --> 00:08:41.714
overloaded the shuttlecraft's
central computer core.

00:08:41.752 --> 00:08:43.583
All sensor data
have been erased.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.884
Lieutenant Torres
is in Sick Bay now.

00:08:45.923 --> 00:08:47.447
When she reports,
tell her to go over

00:08:47.491 --> 00:08:49.823
those damaged sensor logs
with a fine-tooth comb

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:51.851
to see if she can reconstruct
any of the data.

00:08:51.895 --> 00:08:52.862
Aye, Captain.

00:08:52.896 --> 00:08:54.090
Well, this is going
to make things

00:08:54.131 --> 00:08:55.223
a little more difficult.

00:08:55.265 --> 00:08:57.165
I've been using
the long-range sensors

00:08:57.201 --> 00:08:59.260
to analyze the nebula
you discovered.

00:08:59.303 --> 00:09:02.136
It's sending out strong
electromagnetic radiation.

00:09:02.172 --> 00:09:05.300
We won't be able
to scan inside it.

00:09:07.144 --> 00:09:10.807
You know, it sounds to me
like a perfect hiding place.

00:09:10.848 --> 00:09:12.145
I agree.

00:09:12.182 --> 00:09:15.083
I don't like the idea
of going in there blind.

00:09:15.119 --> 00:09:16.780
Let me see if I can
reconfigure the sensors

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.845
to a multiphasic bandwidth.

00:09:20.758 --> 00:09:22.225
Is there a problem?

00:09:22.259 --> 00:09:25.558
I've lost all sensor contact
with the nebula.

00:09:25.596 --> 00:09:28.224
I don't understand.

00:09:29.366 --> 00:09:31.197
Wait a minute.
We've altered course.

00:09:31.235 --> 00:09:32.202
Mr. Paris?

00:09:32.236 --> 00:09:35.831
Our new heading is 121 mark 6.

00:09:35.873 --> 00:09:38.535
We've completely
come about, Captain,

00:09:38.575 --> 00:09:40.099
but it wasn't me.

00:09:40.144 --> 00:09:42.169
Mr. Kim, check
the navigational computer.

00:09:42.212 --> 00:09:44.237
Who ordered the course change?

00:09:44.281 --> 00:09:46.249
According to my readings,

00:09:46.283 --> 00:09:48.615
the command was issued
from the conn.

00:09:49.586 --> 00:09:51.816
I'm telling you, it wasn't me.

00:09:51.855 --> 00:09:54.323
And the helm controls
are working perfectly...

00:09:54.358 --> 00:09:55.825
no sign of a malfunction.

00:09:56.827 --> 00:09:58.192
Ensign, transfer helm control

00:09:58.228 --> 00:10:00.526
to your station,
and reset our original course.

00:10:00.564 --> 00:10:02.964
Course laid in.

00:10:03.066 --> 00:10:05.227
Mr. Paris, I want you to run

00:10:05.269 --> 00:10:07.294
a full diagnostic
on the conn station.

00:10:07.337 --> 00:10:08.804
See if you can isolate
the problem.

00:10:08.839 --> 00:10:10.101
Aye, Captain.

00:10:32.463 --> 00:10:35.125
You might have asked
before adorning my Sick Bay

00:10:35.165 --> 00:10:37.133
with animal remains.

00:10:37.167 --> 00:10:38.998
It's a medicine wheel...

00:10:39.069 --> 00:10:41.833
a talisman
used by Chakotay's tribe.

00:10:41.872 --> 00:10:45.308
He once...
showed me how it works.

00:10:45.342 --> 00:10:48.334
He said if anything
ever happened to him

00:10:48.378 --> 00:10:50.710
that I should perform
a special healing ritual.

00:10:50.747 --> 00:10:54.342
The wheel represents
both the universe outside

00:10:54.384 --> 00:10:56.682
and the universe
inside our minds as well.

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:59.553
They believe each
is a reflection of the other.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:04.584
When a person is sleeping
or on a vision quest,

00:11:04.628 --> 00:11:09.122
it's said that his soul is
walking the wheel, but if he's

00:11:09.166 --> 00:11:14.570
in a coma, or near death,
it means that he's gotten lost.

00:11:14.605 --> 00:11:20.168
These stones are signposts...

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:22.644
to help point the way back.

00:11:26.783 --> 00:11:31.277
Not exactly standard medical
procedure, I know, but...

00:11:31.321 --> 00:11:34.085
You've placed the coyote stone

00:11:34.124 --> 00:11:36.922
at the crossroads
of the Fifth and Sixth Realms,

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.861
which would divert
Commander Chakotay's soul...

00:11:39.897 --> 00:11:41.159
that is, his consciousness...

00:11:41.198 --> 00:11:43.325
into the Mountains
of the Antelope Women,

00:11:43.367 --> 00:11:46.336
according to his tradition
an extremely attractive locale.

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:47.997
He might not want to leave.

00:11:48.038 --> 00:11:50.939
How do you know
about the medicine wheel?

00:11:50.974 --> 00:11:51.963
It's my business to know

00:11:52.009 --> 00:11:53.670
about a variety
of medical treatments,

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:57.009
including those based
on psycho-spiritual beliefs.

00:11:57.114 --> 00:11:59.014
Unfortunately, in this case,

00:11:59.082 --> 00:12:01.516
the medicine wheel
won't be much help.

00:12:01.552 --> 00:12:05.010
There's just not enough
of his mind left to work with.

00:12:22.306 --> 00:12:25.002
Find your way home, Commander.

00:12:41.825 --> 00:12:43.486
Hello?

00:12:53.971 --> 00:12:55.768
Is someone here?

00:13:15.392 --> 00:13:17.360
It's like...

00:13:17.394 --> 00:13:20.124
sensing some kind of presence...

00:13:20.163 --> 00:13:21.994
as if someone else were here.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:27.358
Your telepathic senses again.

00:13:27.404 --> 00:13:32.137
Is this like last week,
when you went into Sick Bay,

00:13:32.175 --> 00:13:34.643
and you knew Lieutenant Hargrove
had been there

00:13:34.678 --> 00:13:36.646
only he'd left hours before?

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:38.739
It's not the same.

00:13:38.782 --> 00:13:40.647
That was like...

00:13:40.684 --> 00:13:45.587
like hearing faint music
from a faraway place.

00:13:47.691 --> 00:13:49.591
When I was
in my quarters just now...

00:13:49.626 --> 00:13:50.593
Mm-hmm.

00:13:50.627 --> 00:13:52.993
It was almost tangible.

00:13:53.096 --> 00:13:55.394
I felt like there was someone
in the room with me.

00:13:55.432 --> 00:13:56.399
Who was it?

00:13:56.433 --> 00:13:57.923
I don't know.

00:13:57.968 --> 00:14:00.493
A presence.

00:14:00.537 --> 00:14:02.835
That's all I can say.

00:14:02.873 --> 00:14:06.172
Warp engines still within
normal parameters, Captain.

00:14:08.011 --> 00:14:09.808
We just changed course again.

00:14:09.846 --> 00:14:11.711
Mr. Kim?

00:14:11.748 --> 00:14:14.114
Our new heading is 121 mark 6.

00:14:14.151 --> 00:14:15.618
Get us back on course.

00:14:17.154 --> 00:14:19.213
The helm's not responding.

00:14:19.256 --> 00:14:21.724
I'm locked out.

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:35.570
This command station
has been blocked.

00:14:35.605 --> 00:14:36.833
From where?

00:14:36.873 --> 00:14:39.967
The lockout originated
on Deck 12, Section B-7...

00:14:40.043 --> 00:14:40.975
navigational control.

00:14:41.044 --> 00:14:42.909
See if you can
reestablish control.

00:14:44.781 --> 00:14:47.306
I've checked every ODN junction
in the helm control network

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:48.874
and I still can't find
the problem.

00:14:48.919 --> 00:14:50.750
Seems we've developed
a new problem

00:14:50.787 --> 00:14:51.754
while you were gone.

00:14:51.788 --> 00:14:53.278
Helm control reestablished.

00:14:53.323 --> 00:14:54.984
Get us back on course
for the nebula.

00:14:55.025 --> 00:14:56.515
Janeway to Torres.

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:57.527
Torres here.

00:14:57.561 --> 00:14:59.153
Who's in the
navigational control?

00:14:59.196 --> 00:15:00.720
No one right now.

00:15:00.764 --> 00:15:02.823
I was there this morning,
and Lieutenant Paris

00:15:02.866 --> 00:15:04.834
was in there
just a few minutes ago.

00:15:04.868 --> 00:15:06.836
That's not true.

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:08.633
Are you certain about that,
B'Elanna?

00:15:08.672 --> 00:15:11.470
Positive. I just saw him leave
about five minutes ago.

00:15:11.508 --> 00:15:13.874
Janeway out.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:16.546
Explanation, Mr. Paris.

00:15:17.513 --> 00:15:19.276
I passed by
the navigational control

00:15:19.315 --> 00:15:22.045
on my way back from the
Jefferies tube, but that's all.

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:26.850
Am I being accused of something
here?

00:15:26.889 --> 00:15:27.947
We are merely following

00:15:28.024 --> 00:15:30.185
a line of deductive
reasoning, Lieutenant.

00:15:30.226 --> 00:15:31.887
Both deviations from our course

00:15:31.928 --> 00:15:33.862
were apparently issued
from locations

00:15:33.896 --> 00:15:35.158
where you were working.

00:15:35.197 --> 00:15:37.961
I'm telling you, I didn't do it.

00:15:38.067 --> 00:15:41.468
Well, I'm willing to rule out
mutiny for the time being.

00:15:41.504 --> 00:15:43.699
I believe you, Mr. Paris,

00:15:43.739 --> 00:15:45.468
but we have to consider
the possibility

00:15:45.508 --> 00:15:47.874
that you might be having
a problem with your memory.

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:49.434
I want you to go
down to Sick Bay.

00:15:49.478 --> 00:15:51.309
Have the Doctor check you out.

00:15:51.347 --> 00:15:52.974
All right.

00:15:53.015 --> 00:15:54.744
Lieutenant Durst.

00:16:10.333 --> 00:16:12.233
Neurotransmitters at normal.

00:16:12.268 --> 00:16:14.566
Synaptic functions stable.

00:16:14.604 --> 00:16:15.730
Hold still.

00:16:15.771 --> 00:16:18.035
This is an extremely
sensitive scan.

00:16:20.009 --> 00:16:22.944
What I wouldn't give to see
good old Doc Brown right now.

00:16:22.979 --> 00:16:23.946
What?

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:25.379
Doc Brown.

00:16:25.414 --> 00:16:27.746
Lollipops in the waiting room,

00:16:27.783 --> 00:16:30.513
no holocomic books
more than six months old,

00:16:30.553 --> 00:16:32.111
house calls.

00:16:32.154 --> 00:16:35.351
I caught a bad cold one time
when I was nine years old.

00:16:35.391 --> 00:16:37.791
The doctor whipped up
a pot of garlic soup

00:16:37.827 --> 00:16:39.454
and brought it over himself.

00:16:40.496 --> 00:16:41.724
Your report, Doctor.

00:16:41.764 --> 00:16:43.595
I still have
a series of tests to perform,

00:16:43.633 --> 00:16:47.262
but other than his irritating
lapses into nostalgia,

00:16:47.303 --> 00:16:48.770
I see nothing wrong with him.

00:16:48.804 --> 00:16:51.773
I guess you're going to have to
round up another suspect, Tuvok.

00:16:51.807 --> 00:16:53.741
On the contrary, Lieutenant.

00:16:53.776 --> 00:16:56.904
I ran a forensics sweep
of the navigational control.

00:16:56.946 --> 00:16:59.813
I found traces of your DNA
on the console.

00:16:59.849 --> 00:17:01.373
That's impossible.

00:17:01.417 --> 00:17:03.544
The cellular residue
you left behind

00:17:03.586 --> 00:17:05.144
is less than 12 hours old.

00:17:05.187 --> 00:17:08.350
Do you still wish to maintain
your innocence?

00:17:09.392 --> 00:17:12.020
To be honest,
I don't know what to think.

00:17:13.396 --> 00:17:16.729
Perhaps my biomolecular scan
will reveal something.

00:17:16.766 --> 00:17:19.462
Keep me informed, Doctor.

00:17:32.715 --> 00:17:34.444
I believe I have found
the ion trail

00:17:34.483 --> 00:17:35.950
of the ship that attacked us.

00:17:36.018 --> 00:17:38.418
It leads directly
into the dark-matter nebula.

00:17:38.454 --> 00:17:40.149
This is the nebula...

00:17:40.189 --> 00:17:42.623
and this is the ion trail.

00:17:42.658 --> 00:17:43.955
As you can see,

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:45.823
their flight path
is highly erratic.

00:17:45.861 --> 00:17:47.590
These planetoids
inside the nebula,

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:48.619
they may be generating

00:17:48.664 --> 00:17:50.894
a dangerous
gravitational effect...

00:17:50.933 --> 00:17:52.298
like storm currents.

00:17:52.334 --> 00:17:54.359
Chances are they've
mapped those currents

00:17:54.403 --> 00:17:56.598
and they're taking
the only safe way through.

00:17:56.639 --> 00:17:58.266
A reasonable assumption.

00:17:58.307 --> 00:18:00.400
I recommend we follow
their exact flight path.

00:18:00.443 --> 00:18:02.502
Agreed.
Lay in a course to the...

00:18:02.545 --> 00:18:04.911
Captain, we're dropping
to impulse power.

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:07.744
I'm reading a massive
energy drain all over the ship,

00:18:07.783 --> 00:18:10.343
and the warp core
is shutting down.

00:18:10.386 --> 00:18:11.876
Bridge to Engineering.
Report.

00:18:11.921 --> 00:18:14.822
Lieutenant Torres,
please respond.

00:18:15.825 --> 00:18:17.087
Mr. Kim, take the Bridge.

00:18:17.126 --> 00:18:18.184
Tuvok, you're with me.

00:18:20.296 --> 00:18:23.288
Torres, what's going on?

00:18:23.332 --> 00:18:24.594
Captain?

00:18:24.633 --> 00:18:26.897
You've initiated
an emergency warp core shutdown.

00:18:26.936 --> 00:18:27.925
What?!

00:18:29.538 --> 00:18:31.768
Too late.
The warp core is off-line.

00:18:31.807 --> 00:18:32.933
It'll take at least two hours

00:18:33.008 --> 00:18:34.407
to regenerate
the dilithium matrix.

00:18:34.443 --> 00:18:37.105
Ensign, get the rest
of the systems back on line.

00:18:37.146 --> 00:18:41.139
Apparently, you've just crashed
the main computer,

00:18:41.183 --> 00:18:44.482
locked out the Bridge
and stopped this ship cold.

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:46.283
Do you want to tell me why?

00:18:46.322 --> 00:18:49.189
Captain, I don't know
what you're talking about.

00:18:52.561 --> 00:18:54.995
What the hell is going on here?

00:18:59.702 --> 00:19:02.796
I've found something
and you're not going to like it.

00:19:04.573 --> 00:19:08.441
This is Mr. Paris' memory engram
for the last 24 hours.

00:19:08.477 --> 00:19:10.536
As you can see,
it has a very consistent

00:19:10.579 --> 00:19:14.675
and distinctive modulation,
except at 1350 hours.

00:19:14.717 --> 00:19:15.911
For one minute, 47 seconds,

00:19:15.951 --> 00:19:18.749
a different memory pattern
appeared.

00:19:18.788 --> 00:19:21.313
1350 hours is also
the exact moment when Mr. Paris

00:19:21.357 --> 00:19:23.791
presumably tampered
with navigational control.

00:19:24.794 --> 00:19:25.761
It gets worse.

00:19:25.795 --> 00:19:27.194
In addition to that,

00:19:27.229 --> 00:19:29.823
there is another disruption
at 1202 hours,

00:19:29.865 --> 00:19:32.095
the moment
when he allegedly entered

00:19:32.134 --> 00:19:33.795
the new course at the helm.

00:19:33.836 --> 00:19:36.270
I also found there's
an identical disruption

00:19:36.305 --> 00:19:38.773
in Lieutenant Torres' pattern,
at the moment

00:19:38.808 --> 00:19:40.435
she shut down warp power.

00:19:40.476 --> 00:19:41.909
I should point out that this

00:19:41.944 --> 00:19:44.174
is a neural electrical
signature...

00:19:44.213 --> 00:19:46.147
what I believe to be
another brain wave

00:19:46.182 --> 00:19:48.082
that was superimposed
on their own.

00:19:48.117 --> 00:19:49.675
Another brain wave?

00:19:49.718 --> 00:19:50.685
Whose?

00:19:50.719 --> 00:19:51.686
I don't know.

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:54.951
It has an unusual
energy signature,

00:19:55.057 --> 00:19:56.547
one I've never seen before.

00:19:56.592 --> 00:20:00.551
Doctor...
what are you saying?

00:20:01.797 --> 00:20:03.765
One possible explanation...

00:20:03.799 --> 00:20:06.165
and the only one
I can think of at the moment...

00:20:06.202 --> 00:20:08.727
is that an unknown
alien entity

00:20:08.771 --> 00:20:11.501
momentarily took control
of their minds.

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:12.632
Intruder alert.

00:20:12.675 --> 00:20:15.735
All security personnel
go to Condition 4.

00:20:15.778 --> 00:20:17.302
Captain, it is possible

00:20:17.346 --> 00:20:20.281
the intruder returned with us
in the shuttlecraft.

00:20:21.684 --> 00:20:23.447
If we're right...

00:20:23.485 --> 00:20:26.977
and there is an alien here,

00:20:27.056 --> 00:20:31.550
it seems intent on preventing us
from going back to the nebula.

00:20:31.594 --> 00:20:34.995
What's more,
it seems to have the ability

00:20:35.064 --> 00:20:37.794
to jump from person to person.

00:20:37.833 --> 00:20:42.133
If that's true,
it could be in any one of us,

00:20:42.171 --> 00:20:46.005
controlling our actions
without us realizing it.

00:20:46.041 --> 00:20:48.839
Well, except for me.

00:20:50.379 --> 00:20:52.142
That's true.

00:20:52.181 --> 00:20:55.480
So far it's only affected
organic beings.

00:20:55.517 --> 00:20:57.007
If it could control the computer

00:20:57.052 --> 00:20:58.644
and navigational systems
directly,

00:20:58.687 --> 00:21:00.985
it probably would've
done it already.

00:21:01.023 --> 00:21:03.685
Which means...

00:21:03.726 --> 00:21:06.058
the Doctor is
the only person on board

00:21:06.095 --> 00:21:07.824
we can trust at this moment.

00:21:11.834 --> 00:21:13.768
Doctor...

00:21:13.802 --> 00:21:17.101
until we have eliminated
this alien presence,

00:21:17.139 --> 00:21:18.197
I can't take the risk

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:20.936
that it could take over
any of the senior officers.

00:21:22.544 --> 00:21:25.308
I'd like to transfer
all command codes to you

00:21:25.347 --> 00:21:26.974
until further notice.

00:21:27.049 --> 00:21:30.541
W-What would that mean?

00:21:30.586 --> 00:21:31.848
That I am in command?

00:21:31.887 --> 00:21:36.119
No. But you will act
as a fail-safe.

00:21:36.158 --> 00:21:37.955
If you feel at any time

00:21:37.993 --> 00:21:40.587
that any of us are under
the influence of the alien...

00:21:41.931 --> 00:21:45.992
you can countermand our orders
and take control of the ship.

00:21:46.068 --> 00:21:48.195
Do you feel up to it?

00:21:48.237 --> 00:21:50.137
Well, of course.

00:21:50.172 --> 00:21:52.800
I make life and death
decisions every day.

00:21:52.841 --> 00:21:54.502
I feel better already.

00:21:54.543 --> 00:21:58.502
Computer, transfer all command
codes to the holographic doctor.

00:21:58.547 --> 00:22:02.142
Authorization: Janeway-eight-
four-one-alpha-six-five.

00:22:02.184 --> 00:22:04.675
Command code transfer complete.

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:06.278
Let's see if we can get
the warp core

00:22:06.322 --> 00:22:07.846
back on line ahead of schedule.

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:08.879
Aye, Captain.

00:22:09.892 --> 00:22:12.326
Captain, I heard
what's happened.

00:22:12.361 --> 00:22:13.794
I think you're right.

00:22:13.829 --> 00:22:15.694
There is an alien presence here.

00:22:15.731 --> 00:22:18.466
I've been sensing
something unusual all day.

00:22:18.599 --> 00:22:19.566
I don't know
how to describe it,

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:20.794
but I know there's
something here.

00:22:20.835 --> 00:22:21.802
Do you know where?

00:22:21.836 --> 00:22:24.396
No. Just that it's on the ship.

00:22:24.438 --> 00:22:26.702
Captain, Kes's
telepathic abilities

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:28.071
are undisciplined.

00:22:28.108 --> 00:22:30.702
If I could initiate
a Vulcan mind-meld with her,

00:22:30.744 --> 00:22:33.110
I may be able to help her focus
those abilities

00:22:33.147 --> 00:22:34.978
to detect the alien
more accurately.

00:22:35.015 --> 00:22:37.108
I'm willing to do that.

00:22:37.151 --> 00:22:39.278
Very well.

00:22:39.320 --> 00:22:40.878
Proceed, Mr. Tuvok.

00:22:51.031 --> 00:22:53.898
The Captain wants to seal off
all critical areas of the ship.

00:22:53.934 --> 00:22:55.299
Make sure the access hatch

00:22:55.336 --> 00:22:57.133
of Jefferies Tube
A-17 is secured.

00:22:57.171 --> 00:22:59.969
So what exactly
are we securing against?

00:23:00.007 --> 00:23:01.599
We're not sure yet,
but we think

00:23:01.642 --> 00:23:03.507
it's some kind of
noncorporeal alien.

00:23:03.544 --> 00:23:04.602
Noncorporeal?

00:23:04.645 --> 00:23:07.637
That means it can probably move
right through a bul...

00:23:07.681 --> 00:23:10.514
Medical emergency, Deck 7
Section 13-Alpha.

00:23:16.924 --> 00:23:19.290
Captain's Log, supplemental.

00:23:19.326 --> 00:23:21.692
It appears that Mr. Tuvok
and Kes were both hit

00:23:21.729 --> 00:23:24.129
by an unidentified
energy discharge.

00:23:24.164 --> 00:23:28.601
Tuvok was not badly hurt,
but Kes is in a coma.

00:23:28.636 --> 00:23:30.900
It was similar to the attack
on the shuttlecraft...

00:23:30.938 --> 00:23:33.406
an energy discharge
came through the bulkhead,

00:23:33.440 --> 00:23:35.738
filled the turbolift
and hit both of us.

00:23:35.776 --> 00:23:37.971
We didn't pick up
a discharge of any kind

00:23:38.012 --> 00:23:39.343
on the internal sensors.

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:42.247
Perhaps this type of energy
is beyond our sensor bandwidth.

00:23:42.283 --> 00:23:43.511
Perhaps.

00:23:43.551 --> 00:23:45.985
But that discharge
had to come from somewhere.

00:23:46.086 --> 00:23:48.987
The most thorough
scanning device we have on board

00:23:49.056 --> 00:23:50.683
is a magneton scanner.

00:23:50.724 --> 00:23:52.988
We could search the ship
centimeter by centimeter,

00:23:53.093 --> 00:23:54.856
but that wouldn't do much good.

00:23:54.895 --> 00:23:57.420
This alien could be
anywhere at any time.

00:23:57.464 --> 00:24:00.524
But what if we could perform
a magneton scan

00:24:00.568 --> 00:24:02.798
on the entire ship all at once?

00:24:02.836 --> 00:24:04.235
What do you suggest?

00:24:04.271 --> 00:24:06.364
A magneton flash-scan.

00:24:06.407 --> 00:24:09.103
We could reconfigure
every sensor array

00:24:09.143 --> 00:24:11.634
on the ship to emit
a single burst.

00:24:11.679 --> 00:24:14.341
It might be enough to illuminate
any anomalous energy.

00:24:14.381 --> 00:24:15.678
Harry, what do you think?

00:24:23.991 --> 00:24:25.583
Whoa!

00:24:25.626 --> 00:24:27.287
What did I do?

00:24:27.328 --> 00:24:28.727
Stay where you are, Mr. Kim.

00:24:28.762 --> 00:24:30.923
I don't see anything unusual,

00:24:30.965 --> 00:24:33.263
but that doesn't mean anything.

00:24:33.300 --> 00:24:34.494
Mr. Kim?

00:24:34.535 --> 00:24:36.628
What were you doing just now?

00:24:36.670 --> 00:24:39.434
I was just thinking.

00:24:39.473 --> 00:24:41.907
I was remembering
an old study I saw

00:24:41.942 --> 00:24:44.638
about magneton scanners.

00:24:46.880 --> 00:24:49.610
I guess my mind
started to wander a bit.

00:24:49.650 --> 00:24:52.813
I'm very disturbed
by what just happened here.

00:24:54.788 --> 00:24:56.915
We don't have
any idea what occurs

00:24:56.957 --> 00:24:59.585
when someone is occupied
by this alien presence.

00:24:59.627 --> 00:25:02.653
If we start pointing
a finger every time

00:25:02.696 --> 00:25:03.788
someone gets distracted,

00:25:03.831 --> 00:25:05.731
it won't be long
before outright paranoia

00:25:05.766 --> 00:25:07.529
starts sweeping the ship.

00:25:07.568 --> 00:25:11.163
Tuvok, B'Elanna, I want
you to get started

00:25:11.205 --> 00:25:13.070
on that magneton flash-scan.

00:25:13.107 --> 00:25:14.199
It's worth a try.

00:25:14.241 --> 00:25:16.641
Dismissed.

00:25:20.080 --> 00:25:21.945
And that's not all.

00:25:22.016 --> 00:25:25.452
Ensign Parsons
ordered his pejuta cold.

00:25:25.486 --> 00:25:26.453
So?

00:25:26.487 --> 00:25:28.853
He always drinks it hot, hot!

00:25:28.889 --> 00:25:30.481
With lemon... but not today.

00:25:30.524 --> 00:25:33.652
Today, it's cold pejuta,
hold the lemon.

00:25:33.694 --> 00:25:36.162
Mr. Neelix, just because a
man changes his drink order,

00:25:36.196 --> 00:25:38.562
doesn't mean he's
possessed by an alien.

00:25:38.599 --> 00:25:40.328
Nevertheless, don't you think

00:25:40.367 --> 00:25:44.360
you should... scan him
or dissect him or something,

00:25:44.405 --> 00:25:45.872
just to make sure?

00:25:45.906 --> 00:25:47.533
I could examine
every crew member

00:25:47.574 --> 00:25:48.802
you've mentioned so far,

00:25:48.842 --> 00:25:50.742
every person on board
for that matter,

00:25:50.778 --> 00:25:52.177
and it wouldn't do any good.

00:25:52.212 --> 00:25:54.510
From what we can tell,
the alien can jump

00:25:54.548 --> 00:25:56.209
from person to person at will.

00:25:56.250 --> 00:26:00.516
Sounds to me like you're
defending Ensign Parsons.

00:26:00.554 --> 00:26:02.044
I'm not defending him.

00:26:02.089 --> 00:26:03.317
I'm just pointing out

00:26:03.357 --> 00:26:05.518
that you're acting
a little paranoid.

00:26:05.559 --> 00:26:07.026
In fact...

00:26:07.061 --> 00:26:10.292
one could say you're acting
a little too paranoid.

00:26:10.330 --> 00:26:11.888
Are you suggesting that I?

00:26:11.932 --> 00:26:13.593
That I could possibly?

00:26:13.634 --> 00:26:16.933
Doctor, I can assure you,
not even an alien intruder

00:26:17.037 --> 00:26:19.403
could make me do
anything to hurt Kes.

00:26:21.809 --> 00:26:23.902
All I'm suggesting, Mr. Neelix,

00:26:23.944 --> 00:26:26.139
is that paranoia is only
going to aggravate

00:26:26.180 --> 00:26:28.705
your already precarious
emotional condition.

00:26:28.749 --> 00:26:30.614
Try to relax.

00:26:30.651 --> 00:26:32.710
I don't think Kes has suffered

00:26:32.753 --> 00:26:35.119
any permanent
neurological damage.

00:26:35.155 --> 00:26:36.520
I'll let you know the moment

00:26:36.557 --> 00:26:38.388
I've had any success
in reviving her.

00:26:39.660 --> 00:26:41.389
I'll be back
as soon as you wake,

00:26:41.428 --> 00:26:42.793
dearest, and don't worry.

00:26:42.830 --> 00:26:44.092
You're in good hands.

00:26:46.033 --> 00:26:47.694
Thank you, Doctor.

00:26:54.208 --> 00:26:55.539
What are you doing?

00:26:55.576 --> 00:26:58.101
I am reconfiguring the
sensor relays on the ship.

00:26:58.145 --> 00:26:59.271
This will only take a minute.

00:26:59.313 --> 00:27:00.439
Must you do it now?

00:27:00.481 --> 00:27:02.449
I'm in the middle
of a treatment.

00:27:02.483 --> 00:27:04.849
I am sorry, Doctor.
Captain's orders.

00:27:04.885 --> 00:27:06.876
How is she?

00:27:06.920 --> 00:27:08.979
No irreparable damage.

00:27:09.990 --> 00:27:12.584
In fact, her injuries
are quite different

00:27:12.626 --> 00:27:14.321
from Commander Chakotay's.

00:27:14.361 --> 00:27:16.693
Her bio-neural energy
is completely intact,

00:27:16.730 --> 00:27:18.630
and I'm curious
about these contusions

00:27:18.665 --> 00:27:19.927
on her neck and shoulder.

00:27:20.000 --> 00:27:22.628
They're not consistent
with an energy discharge.

00:27:22.669 --> 00:27:23.931
They look more like wounds

00:27:24.004 --> 00:27:25.869
sustained during
a physical struggle.

00:27:25.906 --> 00:27:30.434
Odd. There was no physical
struggle that I can recall.

00:27:30.477 --> 00:27:32.274
I just don't understand it.

00:27:32.312 --> 00:27:34.940
The only thing these injuries
come close to resembling

00:27:34.982 --> 00:27:38.042
is an extreme trauma
to the trapezius nerve bundle.

00:27:38.085 --> 00:27:41.646
It's as though her nerve fibers
have been ruptured.

00:27:44.491 --> 00:27:45.924
Come in.

00:27:48.428 --> 00:27:50.692
Lieutenant Torres and I
will be ready to initiate

00:27:50.731 --> 00:27:53.825
the magneton scan
in approximately two hours.

00:27:53.867 --> 00:27:55.300
You should be aware
that it will be

00:27:55.335 --> 00:27:56.597
a high-intensity burst.

00:27:56.637 --> 00:27:58.696
It will cause dizziness
and disorientation

00:27:58.739 --> 00:28:00.639
in all crew members,
including myself,

00:28:00.674 --> 00:28:02.039
for several seconds.

00:28:02.075 --> 00:28:05.044
Make a shipwide announcement
before you initiate the scan.

00:28:05.078 --> 00:28:06.545
Aye, Captain.

00:28:06.580 --> 00:28:09.413
There is another matter
of some concern.

00:28:09.449 --> 00:28:11.474
It appears that Kes's injuries

00:28:11.518 --> 00:28:13.713
were not caused
by an energy discharge.

00:28:13.754 --> 00:28:15.585
The Doctor has found evidence

00:28:15.622 --> 00:28:17.385
that she was
physically assaulted.

00:28:20.227 --> 00:28:21.956
Assaulted...

00:28:25.232 --> 00:28:27.700
but you weren't
physically assaulted.

00:28:27.734 --> 00:28:30.396
That is correct.

00:28:30.437 --> 00:28:33.804
Is it possible that you
inflicted her wounds?

00:28:35.242 --> 00:28:36.368
Me?

00:28:36.410 --> 00:28:39.470
Maybe you were inhabited
by the alien at that moment.

00:28:40.914 --> 00:28:42.541
It is possible.

00:28:42.583 --> 00:28:43.914
Perhaps we should
have the Doctor

00:28:43.951 --> 00:28:47.284
run a neurological scan to see
if I show a memory disruption.

00:28:47.321 --> 00:28:48.288
Agreed.

00:28:48.322 --> 00:28:49.846
Janeway to Sick Bay.

00:28:51.525 --> 00:28:54.426
Computer, activate emergency
medical holographic system.

00:28:54.461 --> 00:28:56.793
Unable to comply.

00:28:56.830 --> 00:28:59.424
The EMH program
has been disabled.

00:28:59.466 --> 00:29:01.058
Disabled? By whom?

00:29:01.101 --> 00:29:02.728
Unknown.

00:29:06.573 --> 00:29:10.031
The Doctor's initialization
routine has been locked out.

00:29:10.077 --> 00:29:12.011
It's encrypted.

00:29:12.045 --> 00:29:14.377
I can't reactivate the program.

00:29:14.414 --> 00:29:15.813
It appears the lockout

00:29:15.849 --> 00:29:17.908
originated
somewhere above Deck 4.

00:29:18.018 --> 00:29:20.586
Why would someone
deactivate the Doctor?

00:29:20.719 --> 00:29:24.314
The Doctor does hold
the command codes to Voyager.

00:29:24.356 --> 00:29:26.916
Yes, but once
he was deactivated,

00:29:26.992 --> 00:29:29.222
the codes automatically
reverted back to me.

00:29:31.496 --> 00:29:32.724
If we assume the alien

00:29:32.764 --> 00:29:35.198
could not take over
the holographic doctor,

00:29:35.233 --> 00:29:38.464
then logically, it would try
to force the command codes

00:29:38.503 --> 00:29:40.664
back into a humanoid host.

00:29:45.043 --> 00:29:46.943
Me.

00:29:50.449 --> 00:29:52.542
It's too dangerous
for one person

00:29:52.584 --> 00:29:55.314
to retain the command codes
at this point.

00:29:55.354 --> 00:29:58.380
I suggest we divide
my command protocols

00:29:58.423 --> 00:30:00.152
into two code groupings.

00:30:00.192 --> 00:30:01.887
A sensible precaution.

00:30:01.927 --> 00:30:03.588
You would be
the reasonable choice

00:30:03.629 --> 00:30:05.426
to hold the second grouping,

00:30:05.464 --> 00:30:09.093
if there's any such thing as
a reasonable choice right now.

00:30:11.637 --> 00:30:15.368
The alien could occupy
either one of us at any time.

00:30:15.407 --> 00:30:19.241
But, presumably, not both
of us at the same time.

00:30:19.277 --> 00:30:20.938
I'll tell
the Bridge crew the plan.

00:30:20.979 --> 00:30:23.914
We'll all have to act as checks
and balances for each other.

00:30:23.949 --> 00:30:26.941
I want you all to be aware
of something that has happened...

00:30:26.985 --> 00:30:30.785
something I must assume
was due to the alien.

00:30:30.822 --> 00:30:32.312
The Doctor has been deactivated,

00:30:32.357 --> 00:30:33.984
and we can't get him
back on line.

00:30:34.059 --> 00:30:37.187
I have decided to divide
my command protocols.

00:30:40.098 --> 00:30:41.156
Captain...

00:30:45.537 --> 00:30:46.731
Stun her.

00:30:46.772 --> 00:30:47.796
She's the alien.

00:31:18.837 --> 00:31:20.464
That should do it, Captain.

00:31:20.505 --> 00:31:21.472
Thank you, Mr. Paris.

00:31:21.506 --> 00:31:23.406
I feel better already.

00:31:23.442 --> 00:31:26.343
Any luck getting
the Doctor back on line?

00:31:26.378 --> 00:31:27.845
Not yet.
Whoever did this

00:31:27.879 --> 00:31:29.642
put up one hell of a roadblock.

00:31:29.681 --> 00:31:30.875
I'm going to have
to break through

00:31:30.916 --> 00:31:32.383
at least six levels
of encryption

00:31:32.417 --> 00:31:33.645
to access the holo-emitters.

00:31:33.685 --> 00:31:34.982
How long is it going to take?

00:31:35.087 --> 00:31:37.146
Two, maybe three hours.

00:31:37.189 --> 00:31:38.156
Torres to Janeway.

00:31:38.190 --> 00:31:39.157
Go ahead.

00:31:39.191 --> 00:31:40.954
Captain, can you come down
to Engineering?

00:31:40.992 --> 00:31:42.584
There's something here
I think you should see.

00:31:42.627 --> 00:31:43.958
I'm on my way.
Mr. Paris?

00:31:43.995 --> 00:31:46.725
You're our temporary medic
until the Doctor returns.

00:31:46.765 --> 00:31:47.732
Right.

00:31:47.766 --> 00:31:49.131
Ensign, I need you
on the Bridge.

00:31:52.170 --> 00:31:53.967
I've been trying
to reconstruct

00:31:54.005 --> 00:31:54.994
the damaged sensor logs

00:31:55.073 --> 00:31:57.200
from Tuvok and
Chakotay's shuttlecraft.

00:31:57.242 --> 00:32:01.201
I didn't have any luck
until I ran a parity trace scan.

00:32:01.246 --> 00:32:03.874
Captain, the sensor logs
weren't destroyed

00:32:03.915 --> 00:32:05.610
by an energy discharge.

00:32:05.650 --> 00:32:07.049
Someone erased them,

00:32:07.085 --> 00:32:08.848
and then overloaded
the sensor matrix

00:32:08.887 --> 00:32:10.912
to make it look
like they'd been damaged.

00:32:10.956 --> 00:32:12.947
It gets worse.

00:32:12.991 --> 00:32:14.959
There was
enough information left

00:32:14.993 --> 00:32:16.824
in the backup logs
for me to reconstruct

00:32:16.862 --> 00:32:18.352
what happened during the attack.

00:32:18.396 --> 00:32:19.954
They were near
a dark-matter nebula,

00:32:20.065 --> 00:32:22.363
and an energy discharge
did breach the hull,

00:32:22.400 --> 00:32:25.028
but there was no other ship.

00:32:26.104 --> 00:32:27.071
No ship?

00:32:27.105 --> 00:32:28.129
I'm certain of it.

00:32:28.173 --> 00:32:29.231
From what I can tell,

00:32:29.274 --> 00:32:31.572
the energy discharge
came from the nebula itself.

00:32:37.516 --> 00:32:39.484
Why would Tuvok lie
about an attack?

00:32:39.518 --> 00:32:41.884
He must have been under
the alien's influence.

00:32:41.920 --> 00:32:43.478
Bridge to Janeway.

00:32:43.522 --> 00:32:45.547
We're approaching
the dark-matter nebula.

00:32:45.590 --> 00:32:46.716
Acknowledged.

00:32:46.758 --> 00:32:48.783
How long until the magneton
flash-scan is ready to go?

00:32:48.827 --> 00:32:51.261
The sensor arrays
are charging now.

00:32:51.296 --> 00:32:53.264
15, maybe 20 minutes.

00:32:53.298 --> 00:32:55.163
When it's ready,
transfer control of the scan

00:32:55.200 --> 00:32:56.258
to the Bridge.

00:32:56.301 --> 00:32:58.166
In the meantime,
I think we should

00:32:58.203 --> 00:33:00.000
take a look
at exactly what it is

00:33:00.071 --> 00:33:01.800
we're not supposed to see.

00:33:09.748 --> 00:33:12.046
Mr. Tuvok, can you locate
the ion trail

00:33:12.083 --> 00:33:14.847
of the alien ship
that attacked you?

00:33:14.886 --> 00:33:16.251
I believe so.

00:33:18.990 --> 00:33:22.687
Mr. Kim, lay in that course.

00:33:23.695 --> 00:33:25.788
Shields are at maximum, Captain.

00:33:25.831 --> 00:33:27.492
All preparations
for entering the nebula

00:33:27.532 --> 00:33:28.499
are complete.

00:33:28.533 --> 00:33:31.969
Captain, I finished
the bio-analysis

00:33:32.003 --> 00:33:34.164
the Doctor was running on Kes
before he was deactivated.

00:33:34.206 --> 00:33:36.197
I think he was onto something.

00:33:36.241 --> 00:33:38.766
If I'm interpreting
his data correctly,

00:33:38.810 --> 00:33:40.607
the bruises on Kes's
neck and shoulders

00:33:40.645 --> 00:33:42.613
were the result
of a Vulcan neck pinch.

00:33:48.787 --> 00:33:49.845
Lieutenant?

00:33:49.888 --> 00:33:52.618
I have no memory
of injuring Kes.

00:33:52.657 --> 00:33:55.649
Perhaps I was occupied
by the alien at that time.

00:33:55.694 --> 00:33:57.184
Perhaps so.

00:33:57.229 --> 00:34:02.929
But then... why does it
keep attacking you?

00:34:03.034 --> 00:34:08.336
In three separate instances now,
it's assaulted you.

00:34:08.373 --> 00:34:10.933
I am the Chief of Security.

00:34:11.009 --> 00:34:13.034
It may see me
as a particular threat.

00:34:13.078 --> 00:34:16.844
So far, you've posed no greater
threat than anyone else.

00:34:16.882 --> 00:34:20.943
And yet, it keeps
going after you.

00:34:21.052 --> 00:34:23.782
Captain, I believe
you are having

00:34:23.822 --> 00:34:25.949
a typically human response
to circumstances

00:34:26.057 --> 00:34:28.252
which are frightening
and inexplicable

00:34:28.293 --> 00:34:30.625
commonly known as paranoia.

00:34:30.662 --> 00:34:32.596
Maybe...

00:34:32.631 --> 00:34:35.156
but I don't think it's paranoia
that's keeping me

00:34:35.200 --> 00:34:37.065
from picking up
this ion trail of yours.

00:34:37.102 --> 00:34:38.763
What bandwidth are you on?

00:34:38.803 --> 00:34:41.101
I am using a multiphasic scan.

00:34:41.139 --> 00:34:43.733
If you examine the Alpha-K band,
you will see it.

00:34:45.443 --> 00:34:47.673
Yes, here it is.

00:34:47.712 --> 00:34:50.408
A very interesting ion trail.

00:34:50.448 --> 00:34:54.782
There's no sign of any subspace
distortions in its wake.

00:34:54.819 --> 00:34:58.550
According to these readings...

00:34:58.590 --> 00:35:00.683
it's a ship without engines.

00:35:02.627 --> 00:35:04.151
You're lying, Tuvok.

00:35:04.195 --> 00:35:06.857
There is no alien ship

00:35:06.898 --> 00:35:08.525
and there never was.

00:35:08.566 --> 00:35:10.659
We're not going
inside that nebula

00:35:10.702 --> 00:35:12.727
until we get some answers.

00:35:12.771 --> 00:35:14.102
Mr. Kim, reverse course.

00:35:14.139 --> 00:35:15.299
Belay that order.

00:35:15.340 --> 00:35:17.740
That is exactly what the alien
has been trying to do...

00:35:17.776 --> 00:35:19.710
keep us from entering
the nebula.

00:35:19.744 --> 00:35:22.542
I suspect the Captain
has been occupied.

00:35:22.580 --> 00:35:24.480
I am relieving her
of command.

00:35:24.516 --> 00:35:27.417
Ensign, proceed into the nebula,
one-half impulse.

00:35:27.452 --> 00:35:28.680
Don't do it, Harry.

00:35:30.755 --> 00:35:32.154
Now, Ensign.

00:35:36.428 --> 00:35:37.952
No, sir.

00:35:38.029 --> 00:35:39.428
I won't do it.

00:35:39.464 --> 00:35:40.726
I must inform you.

00:35:40.765 --> 00:35:42.528
This phaser is
on wide-beam dispersal

00:35:42.567 --> 00:35:43.534
and set to kill.

00:35:43.568 --> 00:35:45.934
I am taking command
of this Bridge.

00:35:45.971 --> 00:35:47.495
I must ask you all
to stand together

00:35:47.539 --> 00:35:48.972
where I can see you.

00:35:49.040 --> 00:35:50.940
Step away
from the console, Ensign.

00:35:57.349 --> 00:36:01.046
Captain, we're entering
the nebula.

00:36:12.364 --> 00:36:15.128
Captain, I'm picking up
some kind of energy pulses

00:36:15.166 --> 00:36:19.102
in the nebula... highly coherent
with a bio-matrix.

00:36:19.137 --> 00:36:20.468
Life-forms...

00:36:20.505 --> 00:36:22.496
And they're heading this way.

00:36:24.509 --> 00:36:28.512
Those beings out there...
are they your people?

00:36:28.645 --> 00:36:30.340
We are the Komar.

00:36:30.380 --> 00:36:32.314
This is our domain.

00:36:56.606 --> 00:36:58.631
What's happening?

00:36:58.675 --> 00:37:00.438
The warp core has been ejected.

00:37:00.477 --> 00:37:01.910
No.

00:37:01.978 --> 00:37:04.276
No. We must continue.

00:37:04.314 --> 00:37:05.406
Torres to Bridge.

00:37:05.448 --> 00:37:07.006
Captain,

00:37:07.050 --> 00:37:09.917
I think I was just
taken over by the alien.

00:37:09.986 --> 00:37:11.886
One second, I was working
the plasma relays,

00:37:11.922 --> 00:37:13.446
and the next thing I knew,
I was ejecting

00:37:13.490 --> 00:37:14.457
the warp core.

00:37:14.491 --> 00:37:16.425
Acknowledged, Lieutenant.
Stand by.

00:37:16.459 --> 00:37:17.926
I don't get it.

00:37:17.994 --> 00:37:20.462
If the alien's in Tuvok,
how could it be

00:37:20.497 --> 00:37:22.522
down in Engineering
at the same time?

00:37:22.566 --> 00:37:23.931
I don't know.

00:37:24.000 --> 00:37:27.265
Unless there are two aliens.

00:37:27.304 --> 00:37:29.465
Two?

00:37:32.542 --> 00:37:33.702
Wait a minute.

00:37:33.743 --> 00:37:35.904
Lieutenant Torres
isn't authorized

00:37:35.946 --> 00:37:38.312
to eject the warp core
on her own.

00:37:38.348 --> 00:37:41.579
That requires a command
code authorization.

00:37:41.618 --> 00:37:45.110
Computer, who authorized the
ejection of the warp core?

00:37:45.155 --> 00:37:48.591
The authorization was entered
by Commander Chakotay.

00:37:53.563 --> 00:37:54.791
Chakotay...

00:37:54.831 --> 00:37:56.458
How is that possible?

00:37:56.499 --> 00:38:00.560
The alien in Tuvok
wants us in that nebula,

00:38:00.604 --> 00:38:02.037
but there's another presence

00:38:02.072 --> 00:38:03.596
that's been trying
to keep us out.

00:38:03.640 --> 00:38:06.905
It doesn't make sense
unless it's Chakotay.

00:38:06.943 --> 00:38:10.003
And he knows we'll be in danger
if we go in there.

00:38:10.046 --> 00:38:11.104
But he's in Sick Bay.

00:38:11.147 --> 00:38:12.546
He's brain dead.

00:38:12.582 --> 00:38:13.810
Maybe not.

00:38:13.850 --> 00:38:16.910
Maybe his neural energy
was displaced somehow,

00:38:17.020 --> 00:38:19.614
and he's able to move
from person to person.

00:38:22.158 --> 00:38:24.854
Tuvok's engaged
emergency thrusters.

00:38:24.894 --> 00:38:27.021
We're moving again, Captain.

00:38:36.539 --> 00:38:39.269
You brought us here... for what?

00:38:39.309 --> 00:38:41.504
To extract our neural energy?

00:38:41.544 --> 00:38:43.341
Very perceptive, Captain.

00:38:43.380 --> 00:38:45.940
The collective neural energy
of your crew

00:38:46.016 --> 00:38:48.610
will sustain my people
for years to come.

00:38:48.652 --> 00:38:51.086
You don't have to do this.

00:38:51.121 --> 00:38:54.056
Maybe we can help you
find another source of energy.

00:38:54.090 --> 00:38:55.284
Captain, we're under attack.

00:38:55.325 --> 00:38:57.384
We're being bombarded
by the energy beings.

00:39:26.456 --> 00:39:28.253
The magneton scan identified

00:39:28.291 --> 00:39:29.758
the entity
before it left the ship.

00:39:29.793 --> 00:39:32.159
It was a trianic-based
energy being.

00:39:32.195 --> 00:39:35.392
Looks like he's joined
his friends outside.

00:39:35.432 --> 00:39:36.558
Shields are holding,

00:39:36.599 --> 00:39:38.760
but they won't last long
at this rate,

00:39:38.802 --> 00:39:40.292
and the electromagnetic
radiation

00:39:40.336 --> 00:39:41.701
is blinding our sensors.

00:39:41.738 --> 00:39:43.069
I can't find a way out.

00:39:43.106 --> 00:39:44.198
Come about.

00:39:44.240 --> 00:39:45.935
Maybe if we reverse course,
we can just backtrack.

00:39:46.042 --> 00:39:47.236
Yes, ma'am.

00:39:47.277 --> 00:39:49.302
I don't know if that'll work,
Captain.

00:39:49.345 --> 00:39:51.506
Tuvok was navigating
a complicated course.

00:39:51.548 --> 00:39:53.641
We could be going deeper
into the nebula.

00:39:53.683 --> 00:39:55.674
Mr. Kim, maybe you can
reconstruct Tuvok's

00:39:55.719 --> 00:39:56.686
navigational logs.

00:39:56.720 --> 00:39:57.778
I'm on it, Captain.

00:40:00.056 --> 00:40:02.149
Shields down to 65 percent,
Captain.

00:40:02.192 --> 00:40:04.854
The energy beings are starting
to penetrate our defenses.

00:40:26.082 --> 00:40:27.743
I'm not having any luck.

00:40:27.784 --> 00:40:30.150
Tuvok deleted the navigational
logs as he went along.

00:40:30.186 --> 00:40:32.381
He wanted to make sure
we didn't get out of here.

00:40:32.422 --> 00:40:33.548
Neelix to Bridge.

00:40:33.590 --> 00:40:34.557
Go ahead.

00:40:34.591 --> 00:40:37.424
Captain, I can't be sure,

00:40:37.460 --> 00:40:39.485
but I think I was just
taken over by the alien.

00:40:39.529 --> 00:40:41.463
And I've done something
very strange.

00:40:41.498 --> 00:40:44.763
I've rearranged the stones
on the medicine wheel.

00:40:46.703 --> 00:40:47.829
If it's Chakotay,

00:40:47.871 --> 00:40:49.668
maybe he's trying
to tell us something.

00:40:49.706 --> 00:40:53.836
Mr. Kim, activate
Sick Bay Visual Relay 16

00:40:53.877 --> 00:40:55.276
and put it on the viewscreen.

00:40:55.311 --> 00:40:56.972
Aye, Captain.

00:41:01.618 --> 00:41:02.949
What is it?

00:41:03.019 --> 00:41:04.646
What does it mean?

00:41:04.687 --> 00:41:07.485
Is it a code?
A message?

00:41:07.524 --> 00:41:08.923
Or a map...

00:41:08.958 --> 00:41:11.620
Computer, overlay a star map
of the nebula

00:41:11.661 --> 00:41:13.424
on the current viewscreen image.

00:41:15.698 --> 00:41:17.222
The stones are

00:41:17.267 --> 00:41:19.758
in the same position
as those three planetoids.

00:41:19.803 --> 00:41:23.398
Chakotay must be using them
to point a way out.

00:41:23.439 --> 00:41:28.536
Mr. Kim, lay in a course
that takes us along a line

00:41:28.578 --> 00:41:31.479
connecting
those three planetoids.

00:41:31.514 --> 00:41:33.482
Engage.

00:41:38.755 --> 00:41:40.279
Shields failing!

00:41:40.323 --> 00:41:42.314
The aliens
are penetrating the hull.

00:41:42.358 --> 00:41:44.485
Mr. Kim, report.

00:41:44.527 --> 00:41:46.688
We're passing the third
planetoid now, Captain.

00:41:46.729 --> 00:41:48.356
The dark matter density
is thinning.

00:41:48.398 --> 00:41:49.592
Reading normal space ahead.

00:41:49.632 --> 00:41:50.690
Bridge to Torres.

00:41:50.733 --> 00:41:52.724
Transfer all remaining power
to the thrusters...

00:41:52.769 --> 00:41:53.827
including life support.

00:42:00.376 --> 00:42:01.934
We've cleared the nebula,
Captain.

00:42:01.978 --> 00:42:03.946
Main power coming back on line.

00:42:04.047 --> 00:42:05.571
Shields at full strength.

00:42:05.615 --> 00:42:06.946
Hull integrity normal.

00:42:06.983 --> 00:42:10.111
The alien beings
are not pursuing.

00:42:16.259 --> 00:42:20.355
Captain's Log, Stardate 48735.9.

00:42:20.396 --> 00:42:21.954
We have returned
to the coordinates

00:42:21.998 --> 00:42:23.397
where we ejected the warp core

00:42:23.433 --> 00:42:25.094
and have successfully
retrieved it.

00:42:25.134 --> 00:42:27.694
Now we're hoping the Doctor
will be able to successfully

00:42:27.737 --> 00:42:30.706
reintegrate Commander
Chakotay's consciousness.

00:42:36.212 --> 00:42:37.543
Did it work?

00:42:37.580 --> 00:42:39.411
It appears so.

00:42:41.384 --> 00:42:42.578
Commander...

00:42:44.587 --> 00:42:46.248
can you hear me?

00:42:50.627 --> 00:42:51.889
Yes.

00:42:53.630 --> 00:42:56.190
I'm a little dizzy, but I think
I'm all here...

00:43:00.370 --> 00:43:01.428
How did you manage

00:43:01.471 --> 00:43:03.405
to reintegrate
his consciousness?

00:43:03.439 --> 00:43:06.067
It involved
three neural transceivers,

00:43:06.109 --> 00:43:08.509
two cortical stimulators,

00:43:08.544 --> 00:43:10.171
and 50 gigaquads
of computer memory.

00:43:10.213 --> 00:43:12.238
I would be happy
to take you through the process,

00:43:12.282 --> 00:43:13.647
but it would take
at least ten hours

00:43:13.683 --> 00:43:15.514
to explain it all to you.

00:43:17.153 --> 00:43:19.485
Needless to say, it was
a remarkable procedure.

00:43:19.522 --> 00:43:21.251
I would consider
writing a paper about it,

00:43:21.291 --> 00:43:23.725
if there were a convenient forum
in which to publish it.

00:43:29.899 --> 00:43:31.730
What happened, Commander?

00:43:34.103 --> 00:43:37.231
After the attack on the shuttle,

00:43:37.273 --> 00:43:42.575
I had the sensation of...
floating above my own body.

00:43:42.612 --> 00:43:45.672
I thought I was dead.

00:43:45.715 --> 00:43:47.615
And when the shuttle
returned to Voyager,

00:43:47.650 --> 00:43:50.085
you were still disembodied?

00:43:50.218 --> 00:43:51.879
Yes.

00:43:51.920 --> 00:43:54.184
I couldn't speak.

00:43:54.222 --> 00:43:56.690
I couldn't touch anything.

00:43:56.724 --> 00:44:00.160
But then I found that if I
concentrated on someone

00:44:00.195 --> 00:44:01.890
who was in the room with me...

00:44:03.998 --> 00:44:06.762
I could share
their consciousness.

00:44:06.801 --> 00:44:08.894
At first, I could only
do little things

00:44:08.937 --> 00:44:10.165
with the host's body...

00:44:10.205 --> 00:44:13.663
push buttons, work a console.

00:44:13.708 --> 00:44:16.370
As time went on...

00:44:16.411 --> 00:44:19.039
it became easier to do more.

00:44:19.080 --> 00:44:21.640
Sorry I had
to knock you around, Tuvok.

00:44:21.683 --> 00:44:24.413
No apologies necessary.

00:44:30.158 --> 00:44:31.955
Good job, Commander,

00:44:31.993 --> 00:44:34.257
and welcome back.

00:44:34.295 --> 00:44:38.959
To be honest,
I feel like I never left.
